OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dull and rather grey day,
OL,6,Fwith widespread fog, dense in places,
OL,7,Fduring the morning. The fog lifts, but
OL,8,Fit remains cloudy throughout the
OL,9,Fafternoon. The wind remains light for
OL,10,Fmost places, but breezier along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA cloudy night with outbreaks
OL,14,Fof light rain or drizzle. Heavier
OL,15,Fshowers develop offshore and may
OL,16,Faffect parts of Kent. Turning breezy,
OL,17,Fespecially along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
