OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry with sunny spells for most
OL,6,Fareas. Coastal showers may continue to
OL,7,Faffect parts of Kent. Windy along the
OL,8,Fcoast. Temperatures around normal for
OL,9,Fthe time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,13,Fcoming days, with cloudy periods on
OL,14,FTuesday giving way to sunny spells by
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday. Feeling cool,
OL,16,Fwith a brisk easterly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
